轨：把“移动镜子”用于找准光柱位置；不再重复升镜 Z 字路线。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 19}, {"id": "later-flow-00258", "type": "text", "x": 52, "y": 2223, "width": 705.0, "height": 24.3, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 7998, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4386, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793664000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "共同规则：站光 3 秒化光；沿光路手动前后移动。圆号表示先后顺序，箭头不限制回退。", "originalText": "共同规则：站光 3 秒化光；沿光路手动前后移动。圆号表示先后顺序，箭头不限制回退。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 18}, {"id": "later-flow-00259", "type": "text", "x": 52, "y": 2251, "width": 715.0, "height": 21.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 8029, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4403, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793664000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "v01 非比例草图 · 展示完成态光路，按步骤接通 · 恢复点为设计建议；跳距、碰撞和切换待灰盒验证。", "originalText": "v01 非比例草图 · 展示完成态光路，按步骤接通 · 恢复点为设计建议；跳距、碰撞和切换待灰盒验证。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 16}, {"id": "later-flow-00260", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1680, "y": 1180, "width": 1600, "height": 1100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#F7F5EF", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 8060, "version": 1, "ver