lid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 38130, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20910, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793664000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "本关主动放缓：只有花瓣与小镜两处操作。回应来自巨兽局部呼吸，不是整只巨兽移动。", "originalText": "本关主动放缓：只有花瓣与小镜两处操作。回应来自巨兽局部呼吸，不是整只巨兽移动。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 19}, {"id": "later-flow-01231", "type": "text", "x": 1732, "y": 4583, "width": 705.0, "height": 24.3, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 38161, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20927, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793664000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "共同规则：站光 3 秒化光；沿光路手动前后移动。圆号表示先后顺序，箭头不限制回退。", "originalText": "共同规则：站光 3 秒化光；沿光路手动前后移动。圆号表示先后顺序，箭头不限制回退。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "baseline": 18}, {"id": "later-flow-01232", "type": "text", "x": 1732, "y": 4611, "width": 715.0, "height": 21.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#687A7D", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 38192, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20944, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793664000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "v01 非比例草图 · 展示完成态光路，按步骤接通 · 恢复点为设计建议；跳距、碰撞和切换待灰盒验证。", "originalText": "v01 非比例草图 · 展示完成态光路，按步骤接通 · 恢复点为设计建议；跳距、碰撞和切换待灰盒验证。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResi